        "reference": "Exodus 36:4",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "And they spake unto Moses, saying, The people bring much more than enough for the service of the work, which the Lord commanded to make.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 46,
            "end": 51,
            "text": "TG Generosity."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Generosity.",
            "prettyString": "TG Generosity",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Generosity",
                "entryId": "tg-generosity",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 36:5",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "And Moses gave commandment, and they caused it to be proclaimed throughout the camp, saying, Let neither man nor woman make any more work for the offering of the sanctuary. So the people were restrained from bringing.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 36:6",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "For the stuff they had was sufficient for all the work to make it, and too much.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 13,
            "text": "OR materials."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 36:7",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "And every wise hearted man among them that wrought the work of the tabernacle made ten curtains of fine twined linen, and blue, and purple, and scarlet: with cherubims of cunning work made he them.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 78,
            "end": 82,
            "text": "TG Skill."
          },
          {
            "start": 87,
            "end": 95,
            "text": "Ex. 26:1 (1–14)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 96,
            "end": 98
          },
          {
            "start": 153,
            "end": 157
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Skill.",
            "prettyString": "TG Skill",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
