        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 36:19",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "And he made boards for the tabernacle of shittim wood, standing up.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 18,
            "text": "Ex. 26:15 (15–29)."
          },
          {
            "start": 41,
            "end": 48,
            "text": "HEB acacia."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 38,
            "end": 40
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 36:20",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "The length of a board was ten cubits, and the breadth of a board one cubit and a half.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 22,
            "end": 25
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 36:21",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "One board had two tenons, equally distant one from another: thus did he make for all the boards of the tabernacle.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 26,
            "end": 33,
            "text": "HEB which made them fit one to another."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 36:22",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "And he made boards for the tabernacle; twenty boards for the south side southward:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 23,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 36:23",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 23
      },
      {
        "text": "And forty sockets of silver he made under the twenty boards; two sockets under one board for his two tenons, and two sockets under another board for his two tenons.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 10,
            "end": 17,
            "text": "OR bases (also vv. 26, 30, 36, 38)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 24,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 36:24",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 24
      },
      {
        "text": "And for the other side of the tabernacle, which is toward the north corner, he made twenty boards,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 42,
            "end": 50
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 25,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 36:25",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 25
      },
      {
        "text": "And their forty sockets of silver; two sockets under one board, and two sockets under another board.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 26,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 36:26",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 26
      },
      {
        "text": "And for the sides of the tabernacle westward he made six boards.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
