        "verseNumber": 27,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 36:27",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 27
      },
      {
        "text": "And two boards made he for the corners of the tabernacle in the two sides.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 64,
            "end": 73,
            "text": "IE those adjoining the west side."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 28,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 36:28",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 28
      },
      {
        "text": "And they were coupled beneath, and coupled together at the head thereof, to one ring: thus he did to both of them in both the corners.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 29,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 36:29",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 29
      },
