        "text": "And there were eight boards; and their sockets were sixteen sockets of silver, under every board two sockets.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 47,
            "end": 51
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 30,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 36:30",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 30
      },
      {
        "text": "And he made bars of shittim wood; five for the boards of the one side of the tabernacle,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 31,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 36:31",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 31
      },
      {
        "text": "And five bars for the boards of the other side of the tabernacle, and five bars for the boards of the tabernacle for the sides westward.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 32,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 36:32",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 32
      },
      {
        "text": "And he made the middle bar to shoot through the boards from the one end to the other.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 30,
            "end": 35,
            "text": "OR pass."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 33,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 36:33",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 33
      },
      {
        "text": "And he overlaid the boards with gold, and made their rings of gold to be places for the bars, and overlaid the bars with gold.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 59,
            "end": 61
          },
          {
            "start": 67,
            "end": 72
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 34,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 36:34",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 36,
        "verse": 34
      },
